WEBVTT

00:07.902 --> 00:13.662
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:14.162 --> 00:19.752
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws

00:19.792 --> 00:28.342
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.342 --> 00:30.212
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.592 --> 00:34.142
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.472 --> 00:37.972
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.472 --> 00:40.812
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.812 --> 00:45.562
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.692 --> 00:48.902
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.862 --> 00:51.862
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.412 --> 01:01.122
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.452 --> 01:03.462
...with you.
futaride

01:04.462 --> 01:10.172
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.842 --> 01:16.262
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.472 --> 01:24.772
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.772 --> 01:26.602
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:30.092 --> 01:34.052
Students Wanted

01:35.302 --> 01:37.552
Shiratori, what did you do?

01:39.012 --> 01:41.182
Shiratori, sensei is looking for you.

01:42.812 --> 01:44.182
She wants you right now.

01:45.432 --> 01:47.482
Why me?

01:47.482 --> 01:49.442
Good job, smart boy!

01:49.442 --> 01:51.442
I envy your one-on-one session.

01:51.442 --> 01:51.692
Shiratori Ryushi
I envy your one-on-one session.

01:51.692 --> 01:52.692
Shiratori Ryushi

01:54.072 --> 01:55.032
Welcome.

01:55.032 --> 01:55.362
Students Wanted

01:55.362 --> 01:56.452
Um...
Students Wanted

01:56.452 --> 01:59.532
Students Wanted
Shiratori Ryushi-kun, what are your plans for after-school today?

01:59.532 --> 02:00.572
Students Wanted

02:00.572 --> 02:03.622
I'm going home and reviewing what we studied today.
Students Wanted

02:03.622 --> 02:05.122
Students Wanted
I see.

02:05.122 --> 02:07.962
Students Wanted
So you've got no plans.

02:07.962 --> 02:08.792
Students Wanted

02:10.462 --> 02:12.292
Then let's go.

02:12.802 --> 02:14.422
Where?

02:14.422 --> 02:16.172
To your place, of course.

02:17.592 --> 02:19.932
It's a home visit.

02:22.432 --> 02:27.942
<b>Guests after Guests</b>

02:29.812 --> 02:32.272
We have to walk a little more from here.

02:32.272 --> 02:33.402
Sorry.

02:33.402 --> 02:34.402
No.

02:34.402 --> 02:35.612
So, Sensei,

02:35.612 --> 02:36.072
Yes?

02:36.492 --> 02:38.362
what is this visit for?

02:38.362 --> 02:39.912
And why just me?

02:46.452 --> 02:48.712
Where are you, Reiko-san?

02:48.712 --> 02:50.332
What's he doing?

02:50.332 --> 02:53.042
He must be looking for that girl again.

02:53.042 --> 02:54.922
Really?

02:54.922 --> 02:56.712
It's none of your business!

02:57.552 --> 02:59.382
Hey, Shiratori,

03:00.762 --> 03:03.852
it looks like she's just visiting you,

03:03.852 --> 03:06.472
so can I go on my own from here?

03:06.472 --> 03:08.392
I'm busy.

03:10.062 --> 03:13.272
Who said I'm only visiting Shiratori Ryushi-kun?

03:14.862 --> 03:17.232
Nobody did.

03:17.232 --> 03:19.652
Actually, I have no plans today.

03:27.492 --> 03:28.752
Good.

03:28.752 --> 03:31.792
This should be enough.

03:31.792 --> 03:33.672
What are you doing, Tamami-chan?

03:38.672 --> 03:42.972
I had a bad feeling, so I set up some charms.

03:44.552 --> 03:45.472
Charms?

03:46.682 --> 03:48.682
I'm home, Kozue Onee-chan.

03:48.682 --> 03:50.562
Welcome home.

03:51.352 --> 03:52.442
Do we have a guest?

03:52.442 --> 03:54.062
Yeah, she's my friend, Sacchan.

03:54.562 --> 03:57.732
Hello, and nice to meet you.

03:58.402 --> 04:00.322
Please enjoy your stay.

04:00.322 --> 04:01.362
Yes.

04:01.362 --> 04:02.492
Also...

04:03.032 --> 04:05.162
...one more friend...

04:05.162 --> 04:09.452
Come on, quit hiding there, and say hello.

04:12.462 --> 04:14.712
Who's hiding?

04:14.712 --> 04:17.632
I was just passing by.

04:17.632 --> 04:20.012
Yes, just passing by.

04:22.472 --> 04:24.892
Actually, she's the one who's hiding.

04:31.852 --> 04:33.732
Is she your friend?

04:33.732 --> 04:36.442
Yeah, we've met once before.

04:36.442 --> 04:38.942
Oh, she came to visit you too?

04:38.942 --> 04:40.322
That's good, then.

04:43.202 --> 04:46.702
Hey, do you want to play with us?

04:46.702 --> 04:50.952
Oh, I didn't know you were Kurosuke-san's friend.

04:50.952 --> 04:54.412
If you want to play with us, tell me first.

04:57.332 --> 05:00.842
What the hell are you doing to Asami's friend?!

05:00.842 --> 05:02.262
Micchan!

05:06.552 --> 05:08.722
U-Um...

05:10.432 --> 05:11.142
Yes.

05:12.222 --> 05:12.932
Anything wrong?

05:13.272 --> 05:14.982
N-Nothing...

05:19.612 --> 05:23.532
Oh, yeah, we haven't introduced each other yet.

05:23.532 --> 05:25.282
I'm Kurosaki Asami.

05:25.282 --> 05:25.992
What's your name?

05:26.412 --> 05:27.412
Mahiru.

05:28.242 --> 05:29.742
I'm Minazuki Mahiru.

05:30.082 --> 05:32.792
So you're Mahiru-chan.

05:33.622 --> 05:37.002
So you called her a friend without knowing her name?

05:40.132 --> 05:42.252
This is our room.

05:42.252 --> 05:44.212
Cool.

05:44.212 --> 05:45.762
Wake up.

05:47.182 --> 05:48.472
What are you doing?!

05:48.892 --> 05:50.222
My...

05:50.222 --> 05:52.042
My delicate derriere!

05:52.042 --> 05:52.602
Derriere
My delicate derriere!

05:52.602 --> 05:53.642
Derriere
Derriere...?

05:53.642 --> 05:55.292
Derriere

05:55.732 --> 05:57.232
We're here now.

06:00.902 --> 06:02.232
Oh, really?

06:02.232 --> 06:05.362
Oh, what should I do?

06:08.362 --> 06:09.912
I'm home, Mom.

06:14.952 --> 06:17.502
T-This is...

06:17.502 --> 06:19.212
Could it be...

06:23.172 --> 06:27.222
That's why I said we should finish the whole thing last night.

06:27.222 --> 06:29.682
You are slacking off and sleeping again.

06:29.682 --> 06:30.642
Mom!

06:30.642 --> 06:32.432
Wake up, Mom!

06:32.432 --> 06:36.772
Kurosaki-san seems to be having a pretty tough time.

06:36.772 --> 06:38.772
For once, I agree with you.

06:40.152 --> 06:42.482
Mom! Mom! Mom!

06:44.022 --> 06:45.112
I'm sorry.

06:45.112 --> 06:46.992
What's wrong, Asami?

06:46.992 --> 06:50.492
I know you came to play, but it looks like I can't.

06:50.492 --> 06:52.992
I must finish our work.

06:55.792 --> 06:58.582
Then I'll help you with your work.

06:59.462 --> 07:01.252
It'll get done faster that way.

07:01.252 --> 07:02.882
Let's play after that.

07:02.882 --> 07:04.592
I can't ask you to help.

07:05.002 --> 07:06.422
It's not a big deal, Asami.

07:06.422 --> 07:08.472
Don't say that.

07:08.472 --> 07:09.842
We're friends.

07:10.972 --> 07:12.222
Sacchan...

07:13.092 --> 07:14.222
Asami.

07:14.222 --> 07:15.472
Sacchan...

07:17.182 --> 07:18.392
Mother!

07:21.392 --> 07:22.732
Welcome home.

07:23.402 --> 07:25.322
Mom...

07:25.322 --> 07:27.232
Oh, yeah...

07:28.612 --> 07:31.362
Everyone is helping us with our work today.

07:31.362 --> 07:32.362
Everyone?

07:32.362 --> 07:33.912
Hello.

07:46.422 --> 07:47.212
Asami.

07:47.882 --> 07:49.052
What?

07:50.762 --> 07:51.722
Dinner.

07:59.352 --> 08:01.482
What are you cooking?

08:03.142 --> 08:05.232
It's a secret.

08:07.522 --> 08:09.692
Let me guess, then.

08:10.942 --> 08:12.952
Well...

08:15.412 --> 08:17.832
Are you cooking your favorite, nikujaga?

08:19.292 --> 08:20.622
Who knows?

08:21.292 --> 08:24.872
But isn't that pot a bit too big?

08:32.012 --> 08:34.092
I must make a lot today.

08:37.352 --> 08:40.812
Oh, by the way, Tamami-chan, about the charms you were talking about earlier...

08:40.812 --> 08:43.232
Oh, that?

08:43.232 --> 08:47.152
Someone said that she wanted to come see me all of a sudden.

08:47.152 --> 08:49.272
So I was putting up a barrier.

08:50.692 --> 08:51.822
A barrier?

08:58.532 --> 09:01.662
This is a pretty good barrier.

09:02.252 --> 09:05.872
Someone who can put up such a strong barrier...

09:05.872 --> 09:09.292
Someone who knows I am anti-garlic...

09:09.292 --> 09:12.382
There's only one such person.

09:13.212 --> 09:15.382
Thank you.

09:16.222 --> 09:21.892
Member Tamami, this is pretty tough.

09:27.102 --> 09:28.442
Mom...

09:32.652 --> 09:35.152
Dinner...

09:41.662 --> 09:43.042
You fell asleep again!

09:43.042 --> 09:45.082
You can't sleep, Mom!

09:45.082 --> 09:45.622
Looks like we have to work hard.
You can't sleep, Mom!

09:45.622 --> 09:47.582
Looks like we have to work hard.
Wake up, Mom!

09:47.582 --> 09:47.962
Looks like we have to work hard.

09:47.962 --> 09:48.882
Us?

09:48.882 --> 09:50.252
Why me too?

09:50.252 --> 09:51.922
Why? Why?

09:52.382 --> 09:55.092
Let's get to work, Asami.

09:55.092 --> 09:59.182
I'm sure it'll be fun working while we talk.

10:00.012 --> 10:01.392
Working together?

10:02.972 --> 10:06.272
While we talk...

10:06.772 --> 10:09.902
...working together....

10:11.402 --> 10:12.982
That's fun.

10:13.692 --> 10:15.322
Let's work!

10:15.322 --> 10:18.822
There's no time to waste!

10:20.572 --> 10:21.452
Right there!

10:21.452 --> 10:23.872
Don't just sit there, help us!

10:23.872 --> 10:24.912
Micchan,

10:25.952 --> 10:26.962
it's okay.

10:26.962 --> 10:30.882
We'll handle it, so I'm sorry.

10:30.882 --> 10:33.042
I know you came all the way out here...

10:35.302 --> 10:37.132
I'm really sorry...

10:38.172 --> 10:39.222
So, this...

10:40.012 --> 10:42.472
This is your work?

10:43.682 --> 10:45.062
Yeah.

10:45.062 --> 10:48.022
Why do you have to work?

10:48.022 --> 10:49.602
Because we're poor.

10:51.982 --> 10:53.902
You're... poor?

10:54.442 --> 10:56.402
You mean, you don't have money?

10:56.942 --> 10:59.402
I'm used to it, so it's okay.

10:59.902 --> 11:01.282
How long does it take...

11:02.412 --> 11:04.282
...to finish this work?

11:05.622 --> 11:09.622
Everyone is helping me, so I think we can finish by the deadline.

11:09.622 --> 11:10.922
Deadline...?

11:12.712 --> 11:13.922
When is that?

11:14.462 --> 11:17.422
Well, it's before morning.

11:18.972 --> 11:19.922
Okay.

11:21.972 --> 11:23.182
Did you call me?

11:24.182 --> 11:24.932
Tachibana.

11:26.062 --> 11:27.062
Roger.

11:28.272 --> 11:29.562
Roger?

11:29.562 --> 11:30.562
What?

11:54.132 --> 11:55.962
Aren't they too fast?

11:59.302 --> 12:01.172
They'll be done in no time.

12:01.172 --> 12:04.892
We'll have more time to play at this rate.

12:04.892 --> 12:05.722
Yeah.

12:06.432 --> 12:07.682
Ouch!

12:10.642 --> 12:13.312
It wouldn't be fun otherwise.

12:15.232 --> 12:19.782
Fine, I'll get serious too.

12:22.902 --> 12:27.412
Great father of magick, Aleister Crowley!
TL Note: Aleister Crowley - self proclaimed sex and drug fiend, master of occult and magick, 1875-1947

12:27.412 --> 12:29.242
TL Note: Aleister Crowley - self proclaimed sex and drug fiend, master of occult and magick, 1875-1947
Give me power!

12:29.242 --> 12:30.202
TL Note: Aleister Crowley - self proclaimed sex and drug fiend, master of occult and magick, 1875-1947
What's this?

12:33.042 --> 12:34.422
Who are you?

12:34.422 --> 12:36.212
Get lost if you're doing door-to-door sales.

12:36.212 --> 12:40.632
Could you be Aleister Crowley?

12:40.632 --> 12:41.922
What the heck is that?

12:41.922 --> 12:43.342
Are you crazy?

12:44.512 --> 12:48.352
Are you telling me that I'm insane?

12:48.352 --> 12:49.222
What?!

12:49.222 --> 12:50.222
You're creepy.

12:50.682 --> 12:53.062
Creepy?

12:53.062 --> 12:56.232
What an exciting word.

12:56.232 --> 12:59.022
I think I'm dying.

12:59.022 --> 12:59.822
More!

12:59.822 --> 13:01.152
Rebuke me more!

13:01.152 --> 13:03.742
Abuse me more and more!

13:03.742 --> 13:04.572
Let me go!

13:04.572 --> 13:05.492
Damn!

13:06.112 --> 13:07.742
Haibara! She's really crazy.

13:07.742 --> 13:09.452
We'd better not have anything to do with her.

13:09.452 --> 13:09.532
Oh, wait!
We'd better not have anything to do with her.

13:09.532 --> 13:11.702
Oh, wait!

13:13.252 --> 13:16.712
His abuse was so wonderful.

13:16.712 --> 13:19.962
He is no ordinary man.

13:19.962 --> 13:22.052
He grabbed the barrier with his bare hands too.

13:22.552 --> 13:23.382
Barrier?

13:33.272 --> 13:36.232
I'm going to go check on the barriers.

13:36.232 --> 13:37.192
Okay.

13:38.442 --> 13:41.522
Kozue, we found this.

13:41.522 --> 13:44.072
Oh, garlic!

13:44.072 --> 13:47.112
I was just wishing for some to put in this.

13:48.032 --> 13:49.782
That's good.

13:49.782 --> 13:51.332
Use all you want.

13:51.332 --> 13:52.792
Thank you, it really helps.

13:53.202 --> 13:56.502
Anyway, that's a rather large pot.

13:56.502 --> 13:58.502
Do we have guests?

13:58.502 --> 14:01.842
Asami-chan's friends are visiting.

14:01.842 --> 14:04.262
Also, Shiratori-san called too.

14:07.632 --> 14:12.512
Well, I have to go drink with Megumi.

14:13.812 --> 14:17.892
I'm making a lot, so snack light.

14:17.892 --> 14:20.022
I'll be looking forward to it.

14:20.022 --> 14:20.772
Okay.

14:21.312 --> 14:23.772
So, what are you cooking?

14:25.322 --> 14:26.782
It's a secret.

14:33.032 --> 14:34.162
It's done.

14:34.162 --> 14:35.292
Wow.

14:35.292 --> 14:37.292
My dream of working together...

14:37.912 --> 14:38.792
Good work.

14:38.792 --> 14:39.502
No problem.

14:43.712 --> 14:44.802
Mom?

14:44.802 --> 14:47.052
Asami, dinner...

14:51.302 --> 14:52.762
Sensei, here we are.

14:52.762 --> 14:56.062
Oh, this looks wonderful.

14:56.062 --> 14:58.812
Oh, something smells good.

15:00.442 --> 15:01.562
Oh, yeah.

15:04.652 --> 15:06.322
Hey, isn't she...

15:06.652 --> 15:08.862
That's a rather unique resident.

15:08.862 --> 15:10.152
No...

15:13.122 --> 15:15.622
Looks like the barrier is working...

15:19.002 --> 15:21.212
Or not!

15:24.592 --> 15:27.672
You were hiding in there.

15:27.672 --> 15:30.842
Why won't you give up, you pervert!

15:33.222 --> 15:36.472
Cheeky girl, I'll make you cry.

15:36.472 --> 15:38.852
That's my line.

15:42.232 --> 15:44.772
Answer my summon, Asmodel!

15:53.952 --> 15:56.492
Answer my summon, Galnov!

16:05.132 --> 16:10.262
Now is the time to settle our epic battle once and for all.

16:10.262 --> 16:12.012
Prepare yourself, President.

16:12.302 --> 16:14.262
Oh, my.

16:14.642 --> 16:18.012
I've never seen such a wonderful battle before.

16:18.812 --> 16:19.852
What's wonderful?

16:20.222 --> 16:21.732
Wha?

16:21.732 --> 16:24.062
What's the commotion?

16:24.062 --> 16:25.692
Oh, a fight?

16:25.692 --> 16:27.062
That looks like fun!

16:27.062 --> 16:28.772
Let's join in!

16:29.282 --> 16:33.402
Oh, my master!

16:33.402 --> 16:38.122
Master, please give me courage, power, and love.

16:38.122 --> 16:40.042
Oh, the pervert!

16:40.042 --> 16:42.502
Oh, my master!

16:42.502 --> 16:44.752
That is such wonderful pain.

16:44.752 --> 16:47.252
So, I'm with Tama-kichi.

16:48.502 --> 16:49.462
Your movement...

16:49.462 --> 16:51.172
Is that Drunken Master?
TL Note: Drunken Master (Jui Kuen) - A martial art based on the 1978 Jackie Chan movie.

16:51.172 --> 16:52.922
TL Note: Drunken Master (Jui Kuen) - A martial art based on the 1978 Jackie Chan movie.
Of course!

16:52.922 --> 16:56.432
TL Note: Drunken Master (Jui Kuen) - A martial art based on the 1978 Jackie Chan movie.
I drank on an empty stomach, so I'm three times as drunk!

16:56.432 --> 16:56.932
I drank on an empty stomach, so I'm three times as drunk!

16:56.932 --> 16:57.432
Please, let me worship you, master.
I drank on an empty stomach, so I'm three times as drunk!

16:57.432 --> 17:01.352
Please, let me worship you, master.

17:01.352 --> 17:03.732
I will lead us to victory!

17:03.732 --> 17:06.602
Master! Please give me the wand of the mage!

17:06.602 --> 17:08.112
No!

17:08.112 --> 17:10.732
I shall join them too.

17:13.492 --> 17:15.992
Asmodel
Is he a bull or a demon?!
He blows fire, and destroys the city!

17:16.032 --> 17:18.492
Galnov
Our hero, Galnov
His smile saves the world!

17:23.122 --> 17:26.672
Oh my, this is a great battle.

17:27.962 --> 17:30.922
Jui Kuen Master!
It doesn't look great at all...

17:33.132 --> 17:35.972
But your guard is still weak.

17:36.682 --> 17:39.182
Go, Galnov!

17:39.182 --> 17:40.262
Finish her!

17:40.262 --> 17:41.222
Oh?
Finish her!

17:41.602 --> 17:43.272
This smell...

17:47.642 --> 17:49.192
It's curry!

17:52.482 --> 17:53.782
Yum!

18:01.702 --> 18:02.992
It's so good!

18:02.992 --> 18:04.292
I'm sorry.

18:04.292 --> 18:08.372
I had only one rice cooker, so I could only make so much rice.

18:08.372 --> 18:11.212
Oh, no, curry udon made by the beautiful landlady...

18:11.212 --> 18:12.802
It's really good!

18:12.802 --> 18:13.962
It's the best!

18:13.962 --> 18:15.212
Shut up and eat.

18:15.212 --> 18:16.512
Please don't mind him.

18:17.052 --> 18:20.092
Oh, we have lots of umeboshi too.

18:20.092 --> 18:24.222
President, I thought you hated garlic.

18:25.222 --> 18:26.682
The barrier?

18:26.682 --> 18:27.942
Where?

18:27.942 --> 18:30.102
Right there.

18:30.102 --> 18:30.772
In it.

18:31.062 --> 18:34.022
Oh, I used it as a spice.

18:38.742 --> 18:39.702
Hey...

18:40.242 --> 18:43.912
We don't have to eat all together, crammed in like this.

18:43.912 --> 18:45.452
What are you talking about?

18:45.452 --> 18:48.752
This closeness makes this taste even better.

18:48.752 --> 18:49.962
Right, Asami?

18:49.962 --> 18:50.582
Yeah!

18:50.922 --> 18:53.092
The curry pasta is good too!

18:53.092 --> 18:54.592
I know.

18:57.342 --> 18:59.592
Curry and bread go well together too.

18:59.592 --> 19:02.722
They sell curry bread, so it makes sense.

19:03.262 --> 19:07.432
But curry on umeboshi is questionable.

19:07.432 --> 19:08.352
It's ume.
TL Note: "Ume" is "plum", but it also means "delicious".

19:08.352 --> 19:09.602
TL Note: "Ume" is "plum", but it also means "delicious".
Good one.

19:12.022 --> 19:12.982
Tachibana.

19:12.982 --> 19:14.192
It's delicious.

19:23.742 --> 19:26.412
We have some more curry udon, right?

19:27.242 --> 19:29.122
And plenty of umeboshi too.

19:29.122 --> 19:30.542
Ume!

19:32.122 --> 19:33.172
Sayoko-san.

19:33.172 --> 19:35.752
I'll eat this.

19:37.132 --> 19:39.422
Shiratori-san, you glutton!

19:39.422 --> 19:40.222
Yu...

19:40.922 --> 19:43.222
But it's good!

19:43.222 --> 19:46.102
Because it's Kozue-chan's curry, right?

19:46.102 --> 19:47.472
Well, uh...

19:55.312 --> 19:58.232
I'm sorry about making you help with our work.

19:58.782 --> 20:02.112
I'll have it done next time, so come play again.

20:02.742 --> 20:04.782
It was fun, so it's okay.

20:04.782 --> 20:06.582
I'll help you again.

20:06.582 --> 20:07.662
Tachibana.

20:07.662 --> 20:08.662
Yes.

20:10.622 --> 20:12.662
Thank you very much!

20:18.552 --> 20:20.712
We're going home too.

20:20.712 --> 20:23.512
The life of a common family was fun.

20:26.722 --> 20:29.472
You even fed us today.

20:29.972 --> 20:32.022
Thank you very much.

20:32.022 --> 20:32.892
No problem.

20:32.892 --> 20:34.982
Please come visit us again.

20:34.982 --> 20:36.482
Yes, gladly!

20:36.482 --> 20:38.232
She's not talking to you.

20:38.232 --> 20:38.822
Yup, yup.

20:39.152 --> 20:40.232
Oh...

20:41.402 --> 20:43.322
Um, Sensei...

20:43.952 --> 20:47.322
You couldn't have a proper visit,

20:47.322 --> 20:49.032
so are you coming tomorrow?

20:49.032 --> 20:50.242
No.

20:50.242 --> 20:52.332
I saw everything.

20:53.122 --> 20:57.712
I understand how you can draw so well.

20:58.252 --> 20:59.842
That's enough.

21:01.802 --> 21:04.012
Please excuse us.

21:04.882 --> 21:07.722
It's your place next.

21:08.642 --> 21:09.812
Right now?!

21:09.812 --> 21:11.562
Of course.

21:11.562 --> 21:13.812
Let's go.

21:16.312 --> 21:17.402
That's good.

21:18.652 --> 21:22.612
I'm sorry everyone, but would you help me clean up?

21:22.612 --> 21:23.992
Yes!

21:23.992 --> 21:24.742
Oh?

21:24.742 --> 21:27.262
Did president go home too?

21:39.042 --> 21:42.342
The curry on the bottom of the pan is the best.

21:42.342 --> 21:46.222
Everyone, good job eating the rest of the curry.

21:57.443 --> 22:03.953
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

22:04.033 --> 22:09.753
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:11.173 --> 22:17.633
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:17.883 --> 22:22.933
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:24.893 --> 22:31.643
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:31.893 --> 22:37.573
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:38.573 --> 22:44.413
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:44.413 --> 22:46.663
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:46.873 --> 22:53.043
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:53.543 --> 22:59.383
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

22:59.383 --> 23:04.013
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

